{'symbol': 'MOS', 'date': '2021-11-04 17:37:00', 'title': 'MOSAIC ANNOUNCES LAUNCH OF SECONDARY OFFERING AND CONCURRENT SHARE REPURCHASE', 'text': 'TAMPA, FL / ACCESSWIRE / NOVEMBER 4, 2021 / THE MOSAIC COMPANY (NYSE:MOS) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT VALE S.A. AND ITS AFFILIATE (TOGETHER, THE "SELLING STOCKHOLDER") INTEND TO OFFER FOR SALE IN AN UNDERWRITTEN SECONDARY OFFERING 34,176,574 SHARES OF COMMON STOCK OF MOSAIC, PURSUANT TO A REGISTRATION STATEMENT FILED BY MOSAIC WITH THE U.S. SECURITIES AND EXCHANGE COMMISSION (THE "SEC").'}